    docs: document TERMINAL_JAIL_HERMES_PLUGIN_DIR. Addresses DOC-24.
    
    Reader-facing docs never mentioned the --hermes-plugin environment
    override. README.md "Install or refresh" block gains the env-var example
    and the precedence chain (explicit --hermes-plugin <dir> /
    --hermes-plugin-dir=<dir> argument > TERMINAL_JAIL_HERMES_PLUGIN_DIR >
    $HOME/.hermes/plugins/terminal-jail default, per the first-non-empty-wins
    chain at install.sh:668-676); docs/quickstart.md section 3d now names the
    variable in the same sentence as the explicit-target flags.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
